{"results":[{"record_id":"full_2026-07-06__rec_003206","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a new method/framework, not a review or benchmark, and the text-bio bridge is central: gene expression is converted into text and used to fine-tune GPT-2. The model also generates biologically valid cells, so it is not just a downstream wrapper.","evidence_snippet":"\"representing gene expression data as text\"; \"convert each cell's gene expression profile into a sequence of gene names\"; \"can be used to fine-tune causal language models like GPT-2\"; \"GPT-2 generates biologically valid cells when prompted with a cell type\"; \"natural language pretraining boosts model performance\"; \"pretrained causal language model\"; \"large language models like GPT\"; \"combine natural language and transcriptomics\"; \"Cell2Sentence captures gene expression data through a set of gene names sorted by their expression levels\"; \"Cell2Sentence, a new approach\"; \"generates biologically valid cells\"; \"fine-tune causal language models like GPT-2\"; \"retaining their ability to generate text\""},{"record_id":"full_2026-07-06__rec_003206","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The paper presents a novel Cell2Sentence framework that encodes single-cell transcriptomics as text and fine-tunes a causal language model on it. The abstract and methods show a substantive text-bio bridge plus generative behavior, so the wrapper exclusion does not apply.","evidence_snippet":"\"representing gene expression data as text\"; \"